            "review_title": "Review at Ya! Restaurant",
            "review_text": "edwin771\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nNice lunch at low price.\nJan 2016 • Business\nI usually go to he restaurant for lunch. The restaurant provides Vietnamese and Japanese lunch set at low price. I am sure the price is not burdensome, and the quality of food is pretty nice.\n\nMenu is different at the afternoon and evening. You can try various and delicious food at both time.\nAlso atmosphere is quite mordern. Every floor has different atmosphere, so you can decide any seats to your own preference, and they provide some mini games that you might get free dish or drink if you won.\n\nOverall, it is worth a visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2016",
