            "review_text": "Đen N\n6 contributions\n0\nFlabbergasted!\nJan 2016 • Friends\nthe service was impressive - we got some very nice conversation with the manager of the place. and we got to prepare our own squid ball (i dont know what they call it)\n\nthe atmosphere was great - the place has a bit of a mixed style but still very authentic.\nThe price is not expensive comparing to other japanese places in the city\n\nMost importantly, the food - Best japanese food i've ever tasted.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2016",
