            "review_text": "riku28377\nVietnam41 contributions\n0\nreasonable but good taste!\nJan 2016 • Friends\nI visited this restaurant with coworkers at first time. \nThis restaurant has not only Japanese dishes but Vietnamese dishes as well.\nPrice is reasonable and volume is enough.\nMy favorite menu is 〝takoyaki\b″. When I was in Japan, I used to eat takoyaki. So I go to this restaurant when I want to eat takoyaki.\nWe can cook takoyaki by ourselvse, so we can enjoy cooking also!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 11, 2016",
