            "review_title": "Review at Ya! Restaurant",
            "review_text": "bay-rainbow\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nGood taste, good price and a cozy place!!\nDec 2015 • Friends\nTheir speciality is Japanese and Vietnamese, it was such a good taste. Also they have some toys, you can enjoy with them for free. It was so kind if the restaurant!!\nTakoyaki, which is a pancake from Osaka, Japan, was amazing. It was first time for me to make and eat Takoyaki. Strongly recommend to try it!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 24, 2015\nMak O\nThank you Nana san! We will keep updating our menu! Looking forward to seeing you again!\nWritten January 6, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
